#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:1
msgid "Amiga Juggler"
msgstr "Żongler Amigi"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"A real-time recreation of Eric Graham's 1987 Amiga \"Juggler\" demo: a GLSL\n"
"port of his recursive ray tracer. The robot, the balls, the checkerboard\n"
"floor and the mirror reflections are all generated and raytraced "
"procedurally.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Odtworzenie w czasie rzeczywistym demo „Juggler” Erica Grahama z 1987 roku "
"na Amigę: GLSL\n"
"port jego rekursywnego znacznika promieni. Robot, kule, szachownica\n"
"podłoga i odbicia lustrzane są generowane proceduralnie i śledzone "
"promieniami.\n"
"\n"
"Napisane przez Briana Bernsteina; 2026.\n"
"  "

